# Asset versioning (cache bust)

Local CSS/JS are loaded with `?v=` from `asset-version`.

After changing any file under `css/` or `js/`, before committing:

```bash
python3 scripts/bump-assets.py
```

Include in the commit: `asset-version` and every updated `*.html`.

Options:

- `python3 scripts/bump-assets.py` — timestamp `YYYYMMDDHHMM`
- `python3 scripts/bump-assets.py --git` — short git SHA
- `python3 scripts/bump-assets.py --sync` — re-stamp HTML with current `asset-version`
